  Detection logic used:
  - Truncation: earliest >= expected && expected > 0 → LogTruncationException
  - Topic reset: earliest=0 && end>0 && expected>0 → seek to beginning
  - Cold start: committedOffset <= 0 → skip checks, use auto.offset.reset=earliest
  - Ambiguous: earliest=0 && end=0 → NOT treated as reset (extreme truncation guard)
